OL,3,GNEWSATrains back to normal after track
OL,4,Afire near Gatwick
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains running between Gatwick Airport
OL,7,Fand Purley are no longer subject to
OL,8,Fdelays following a fire next to the
OL,9,Ftrack between the two stations on
OL,10,FTuesday morning.
OL,12,FGatwick Express said on social media
OL,13,Fthat "disruption caused by this
OL,14,Fincident has now ended" and that delays
OL,15,Fcaused by the fire are now over.
OL,17,FThe provider, alongside both Thameslink
OL,18,Fand Southern, had earlier urged
OL,19,Fpassengers to allow extra time for
OL,20,Fjourneys.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
